Modifications: Nonlinear Optimization Java Package
--------------------------------------------------

This package is a hacked version of an optimisation library from Steve
Verrill (steve@ws13.fpl.fs.fed.us), with some additional functionality
added to facilitate its use within the seismic_inverter seismic
inversion codes. The function prototypes in Uncmin_methods in
particular have been augmented, mainly for the purposes of catching
strange conditions and giving feedback to the driver routines.  In
most other respects, the original Uncmin code from Steve is intact.

You should now read the README, bearing this in mind.

